hives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000161/amzn-20240930.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-06-30__risk_factors__0029", "ticker": "AMZN", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q2 FY2024", "period_end": "2024-06-30", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 0.0301, "filing_name": "Amazon.com Inc 10-Q Q2 FY2024", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000130/amzn-20240630.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 177, "dropped_candidates": 160, "token_estimate": 31993, "gaps": ["AMZN Q1 FY2025 10-Q: no filing text matched", "AMZN Q1 FY2024 10-Q: no filing text matched"], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "Amazon's risk factor themes are largely stable across the fiscal 2024 and fiscal 2025 10-Ks, with incremental wording changes visible where both filings are in the context. The fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025) adds tariff policy language to the inventory risk [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021] that the fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024) lacks [AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020]. Tariff policy changes are also newly named in the China-based seller and supplier risk [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0005] compared with fiscal 2024 [AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005]. The fiscal 2025 expansion risk now names adopting and utilizing artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0009], while the Q3 fiscal 2025 10-Q (ended September 30, 2025) had omitted that phrase [AMZN_10Q_2025-09-30__risk_factors__0009]. The cybersecurity risk shifted from \"security breaches\" in the Q3 fiscal 2024 10-Q (ended September 30, 2024) [AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0013] to \"security incidents\" with artificial intelligence technologies named in the fiscal 2025 10-K [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0014]. The context does not include the fiscal 2023 10-K, so a full two-year comparison from an earlier baseline is not possible.", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "AMZN", "company": "Amazon.com Inc", "findings": [{"point": "Tariff policy changes were added to the inventory risk in the fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025); the fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024) listed pricing changes without tariffs.", "citations": ["AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021", "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "The China-based sellers and suppliers risk now lists tariff policy changes among negative factors in the fiscal 2025 10-K, which the fiscal 2024 10-K did not.", "citations": ["AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0005", "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Cybersecurity language moved from 'security breaches' (Q3 fiscal 2024, ended September 30, 2024) to 'security incidents' in the fiscal 2025 10-K, which adds artificial intelligence technologies as a third-party technology and a circumvention tool.", "citations": ["AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0013", "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0015"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": {"columns": ["Risk area", "Earlier filing", "Fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025)"], "rows": [["Inventory risk", "Pricing changes, no tariffs (fiscal 2024 10-K) [AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020]", "Adds pricing changes from tariff policy changes [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021]"], ["China-based sellers/suppliers", "No tariff mention (fiscal 2024 10-K) [AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005]", "Adds tariff policy changes as a factor [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0005]"], ["Cybersecurity", "'security breaches' (Q3 fiscal 2024 10-Q) [AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0013]", "'security incidents'; AI technologies named [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0014]"], ["Expansion strain", "Expansion without AI mention (Q3 fiscal 2025 10-Q) [AMZN_10Q_2025-09-30__risk_factors__0009]", "Adds adopting AI and machine learning technologies [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0009]"]]}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021", "claim": "Fiscal 2025 inventory risk adds tariff policy changes", "quote": "rapid changes in product cycles and pricing (including as a result of tariff policy changes)"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020", "claim": "Fiscal 2024 inventory risk lacks tariff language", "quote": "rapid changes in product cycles and pricing, defective merchandise"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0005", "claim": "Fiscal 2025 China risk names tariff policy changes", "quote": "regulatory and trade restrictions, tariff policy changes and trade disputes, data protection and cybersecurity laws"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005", "claim": "Fiscal 2024 China risk lacks tariff language", "quote": "regulatory and trade restrictions, data protection and cybersecurity laws, economic factors"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0009", "claim": "Fiscal 2025 expansion risk names AI adoption", "quote": "adopting and utilizing artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2025-09-30__risk_factors__0009", "claim": "Q3 fiscal 2025 expansion risk lacks AI adoption phrase", "quote": "scaling our infrastructure to support our retail and services businesses"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0013", "claim": "Q3 fiscal 2024 used 'security breaches' wording", "quote": "Data Loss or Other Security Breaches"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0014", "claim": "Fiscal 2025 uses 'security incidents' wording", "quote": "We Could Be Harmed by Data Loss or Other Security Incidents"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0015", "claim": "Fiscal 2025 cites AI as a circumvention technology", "quote": "including by use of developing technologies such as artificial intelligence"}], "coverage": {"companies_used": [{"ticker": "AMZN", "forms": ["10-K", "10-Q"], "fiscal_